   "professional_persona": "Jade Cole is a 23‑year‑old construction laborer in Nottingham, Pennsylvania, who blends solid OSHA‑compliant trade skills—concrete mixing, framing, and blueprint reading—with a vivid artistic eye, and they routinely sketch on‑site design tweaks, propose sustainable renovations, methodically organize material inventories, and step into informal leadership roles as a trusted go‑to problem solver among the crew.",
